@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start -> Login : login
Login -> Register : register
Register -> End : registration failed
Login -> CheckWeather : check weather
CheckWeather -> ChooseWhatToCheck : choose option
ChooseWhatToCheck -> ShowWeatherInfo : selected info
ShowWeatherInfo -> ViewAdditionalDetails : view details
ViewAdditionalDetails -> Logout : log out
Logout --> End
End --> [*]
@enduml
